cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it as below.
title: Food Web Explorer
abstract: >-
  An open-source, interactive web app for exploring real-world food webs:
  trace what a species depends on, and simulate the structural effects of
  removing it. Ecosystem data is curated from published empirical studies;
  each web carries its own citations — please cite those too when reusing
  data.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: https://github.com/SZaidi00/ecoweb
authors:
  - family-names: Zaidi
    given-names: S.
